  "instructions": [
    "Preheat grill to medium-high heat",
    "Thread chicken liver pieces onto skewers",
    "In a bowl, whisk together olive oil, lemon juice, garlic, parsley, salt, black pepper, and paprika",
    "Brush the mixture onto the chicken liver skewers",
    "Grill the skewers for 8-10 minutes, turning occasionally",
    "Let the skewers rest for 2 minutes before serving",
    "Serve hot and enjoy",
    "Ensure poultry is cooked to an internal temperature of 74°C / 165°F (juices run clear, no pink remaining) before serving."
